# Which wallets to copy on Polymarket US

Backtest of copytop's own rules over 90 days to 2026-11-16 09:00 UTC: 5610 candidates, 3677 with trades copytop could copy, 238 re-priced at a 60s copy delay. Choosing window: first 67%; test window: the rest (30 days).

